  "notes": "Packaged in a standard sleeve with a matte finish and an inner sleeve with a glossy finish. Some copies have a hype sticker which reads \"Includes the hit singles:- \"It's a sin.\" \"What have I done to deserve this?\" \"Rent\" and \"Heart\" PCSD 104\". The inner sleeve features a photograph of the band on one side and credits on the other side.\n\n[Back Cover:]\n℗ 1987 Original Sound Recordings made by EMI Records Ltd. © 1987 EMI Records Ltd.\nSleeve printed in England.\nManufactured in England.\n\n[Inner Sleeve:]\nPublished by\n[Track A1] Cage Music Ltd/10 Music Ltd/Arista Music/BMG Music Ltd.\n[Track A2] Cage Music Ltd./10 Music Ltd./MCA Music Ltd.\n[Tracks A3-A5, B2-B5] Cage Music Ltd./10 Music Ltd.\n[Track B1] Cage Music Ltd./10 Music Ltd..General Music-MCPS\nRecorded in London at Sarm West and Advision Studios.\nThanks to Spike, Bobby \"O\" and Mike Nielson.\n\"actually\" is a digital recording, digitally mixed and mastered.\n\n[Centre Labels:]\nMANUFACTURED IN THE UK BY EMI RECORDS LIMITED",
